-- title:
--   Affine preprocessing and reversible gate interfaces
-- statement:
--   The concrete affine sampler is applied independently to the blocks of an LWE sample table before a single call to a quantum distinguisher. These definitions specify block and table preprocessing, the corresponding finite probability experiments, reversible circuit inverses, and the controlled classical gates used in the implementation.
